v-issue.blend.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27448646/uv-issue.blend.zip)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the included blend file, or create an empty blend file and make the following node setup.\n\n<img width=\"2036\" height=\"1227\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cc6e269-99a4-4b08-abe5-38b526a56f6b\" />\n\nSave the file in your godot project and notice that the imported model has no uv map.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust open the scene uv-issue.tscn\n[uv-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27448777/uv-issue.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119286/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119286/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}